tinygeodesy is an independent implementation of ellipsoidal coordinate equations.
Reference outputs use pymap3d 3.2.0 (BSD licensed) for forward ECEF and local bases,
and mpmath 1.4.1 (BSD licensed) for an independent 90-digit inverse normal root.
Raw pymap3d inverse comparisons, reference outputs, and generators stay ignored in
.validation/tinygeodesy/. No external runtime is linked or fetched by tests.
https://github.com/geospace-code/pymap3d
https://github.com/mpmath/mpmath
